# Patterns

## Repository Pattern

- Encapsulate data access behind an interface (findAll, findById, create, update, delete)
- Business logic depends on the interface, not the storage implementation

## API Response Envelope

All API responses use a consistent envelope:
- `success` / `status` indicator
- `data` payload (nullable on error)
- `error` message (nullable on success)
- `meta` for pagination (total, page, limit)
